%% source: the report's "criterion and conditions" (statistical significance plus a statable mechanism) and its "not yet established" (the threshold waits on data)
flowchart LR
  S(["one factor"])
  G1{"statistically significant?"}
  G2{"can the mechanism behind it be stated?"}
  A1["counts as having an effect"]
  A2["does not count as having an effect"]
  A3(["not yet established: the threshold on effect size"])
  S --> G1
  G1 -- "no" --> A2
  G1 -- "yes" --> G2
  G2 -- "yes" --> A1
  G2 -- "no" --> A2
  A1 -.-> A3
  classDef open stroke-dasharray: 5 5,stroke:#b45309,color:#92400e,fill:#fffbeb
  class A3 open
